{"content":[{"c":["ELIASHIB"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Elioenai’s son and a descendant of Zerubbabel in the royal lineage of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","r":"1Chr.3.24","rawR":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.24","value":"1Chr.3.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Aaron’s descendant chosen by David to head the 11th of the 24 courses of priests taking turns in the sanctuary services (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.12","r":"1Chr.24.12","rawR":"1Chr.24.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.12","value":"1Chr.24.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. High priest in the second succession from Jeshua (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.10","r":"Neh.12.10","rawR":"Neh.12.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.10","value":"Neh.12.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:10"},"). Eliashib assigned a chamber of the temple to Tobiah the Ammonite, a relative by marriage. When Nehemiah returned from exile, he had Tobiah removed from his temple lodging (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.6","r":"Ezra.10.6","rawR":"Ezra.10.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.6","value":"Ezra.10.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.1,20","r":"Neh.3.1,20","rawR":"Neh.3.1,20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.1,20","value":"Neh.3.1,20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:1, 20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.13.4,7-8,28","r":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28","rawR":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28","value":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28"}],"t":"ref","v":"13:4, 7-8, 28"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Levite and temple singer. He pledged to put away his foreign wife at Ezra’s command (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.24","r":"Ezra.10.24","rawR":"Ezra.10.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.24","value":"Ezra.10.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5, 6. Two men, a son of Zattu and a son of Bani, similarly persuaded by Ezra to put away their foreign wives (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.27,36","r":"Ezra.10.27,36","rawR":"Ezra.10.27,36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.27,36","value":"Ezra.10.27,36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:27, 36"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Eliashib","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.12","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.12","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.12"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.10","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.10","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.10"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.6","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.6","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.6"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:1, 20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.1,20","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.1,20","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.1,20"},{"anchorText":"13:4, 7-8, 28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.13.4,7-8,28","rawQueryValue":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28","sourceRefExact":"Neh.13.4,7-8,28"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.24","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.24","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.24"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:27, 36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.27,36","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.27,36","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.27,36"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"61831893802e11aa3096bc0613091c9a1323322698a231313c3d9ab853c4eb0c","sourceItemName":"Eliashib","sourceItemOrder":92,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Eliashib","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Eliashib","title":"Eliashib","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}